cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Awesome HORIZON SHIELD: the complete, checkable inventory of HORIZON SHIELD systems"
message: "If you use this catalog, please cite it."
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Oga
    given-names: Toshikatsu
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-9180-903X"
    affiliation: "The HORIZONs K.K."
repository-code: "https://github.com/ogasurfproject-jpg/awesome-horizon-shield"
url: "https://ogasurfproject-jpg.github.io/awesome-horizon-shield/"
abstract: >-
  Every open dataset, public MCP server and verification ledger operated by
  The HORIZONs K.K. (Japan), each row published together with a way for a
  stranger to check it: a DOI, an official MCP registry entry, daily conduct
  measurements, or a Bitcoin anchor. The operator sells services to the
  industries these datasets describe and discloses it. Nothing here asks to be
  trusted.
keywords:
  - model-context-protocol
  - mcp
  - open-data
  - japan
  - construction-cost
  - home-visit-nursing
  - verification
  - conflict-of-interest
